{"id":"n25307-1-7","stage":3,"title":"전설 · 传说","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25307-1-7-1","ko":"할아버지, 옛날이야기 해 주세요.","zh":"爷爷，请给我讲讲古老的故事吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할아버지,","meaning":"爷爷，姥爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷，姥爷","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"1","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}},{"text":"옛날이야기","meaning":"故事，过去的事，老话","explanation":"옛날이야기：故事，过去的事，老话","readings":[{"term":"옛날이야기","audio":"/audio/69da29207ed35d1921ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68107","senseId":"1","lemma":"옛날이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옛날이야기","audio":"/audio/69da29207ed35d1921ba.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"讲（故事）","explanation":"하다：讲（故事）；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6600340ce9e158e7","term":"할아버지","zh":"爷爷，姥爷","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3","entryId":"74121","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的父亲或母亲的父亲。","pronunciation":["하라버지"]},{"id":"69da29207ed35d19","term":"옛날이야기","zh":"故事，过去的事，老话","audio":"/audio/69da29207ed35d1921ba.mp3","entryId":"68107","definition":"以前的事情被传下来或编造的故事。","pronunciation":["옌ː날리야기"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"讲（故事）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"讲（故事）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/951eb421c1f6fe87acb6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25307-1-7-2","ko":"그래. 오늘은 우리 동네 뒷산에 관한 전설을 들려주마.","zh":"好啊。今天我就给你们讲讲我们社区后山上的传说吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘은","audio":"/audio/45021ad1ec5b4083b856.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"동네","meaning":"小区，社区，村庄","explanation":"동네：小区，社区，村庄","readings":[{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62417","senseId":"2","lemma":"동네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}},{"text":"뒷산에","meaning":"后山","explanation":"뒷산：后山；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"뒷산","audio":"/audio/67e40a6de3acce11076e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67401","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒷산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒷산에","audio":"/audio/b207988415e0b39ecb41.mp3"}},{"text":"관한","meaning":"关于","explanation":"관하다：关于；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"관하다","audio":"/audio/2df2c6b5d50b21ab463c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64365","senseId":"1","lemma":"관하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"관한","audio":"/audio/c409745efba755e4c552.mp3"}},{"text":"전설을","meaning":"传说","explanation":"전설：传说；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"전설","audio":"/audio/d7a38fd8b5b8fe4baf5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25307","senseId":"1","lemma":"전설","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전설을","audio":"/audio/b8d52fca41ba8e9e4222.mp3"}},{"text":"들려주마.","meaning":"给人听，告诉","explanation":"들려주다：给人听，告诉；마：向平辈或晚辈表示说话人的约定、承诺。","readings":[{"term":"들려주다","audio":"/audio/448606e28f3113feee56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64545","senseId":"1","lemma":"들려주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들려주마","audio":"/audio/2540137b843483c57d53.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"f97ccdfe641c2837","term":"동네","zh":"小区，社区，村庄","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3","entryId":"62417","definition":"多户人家聚集在一起生活的地方。","pronunciation":["동ː네"]},{"id":"67e40a6de3acce11","term":"뒷산","zh":"后山","audio":"/audio/67e40a6de3acce11076e.mp3","entryId":"67401","definition":"家或村子后面的山。","pronunciation":["뒤ː싼","뒫ː싼"]},{"id":"2df2c6b5d50b21ab","term":"관하다","zh":"关于","audio":"/audio/2df2c6b5d50b21ab463c.mp3","entryId":"64365","definition":"作为说话或思考的对象。","pronunciation":["관하다"]},{"id":"d7a38fd8b5b8fe4b","term":"전설","zh":"传说",